	"html": "<main><div role=\"main\" class=\"container main-container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"it-content__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-content\" class=\"region content\"><div id=\"it-block-italiagov-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\"> <article role=\"article\" class=\"node node--type-page node--view-mode-full\"> <div class=\"node__content\"><div class=\"layout layout--onecol\"><div class=\"layout__region layout__region--content\"><div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodepagefield-immagine-principale\" id=\"it-\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-immagine-principale field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><article class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-full\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/trattamento-header_0.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"607\" alt=\"trattamento\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div></div><div class=\"block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block\" id=\"it-\"> <nav class=\"breadcrumb-container\" aria-label=\"breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"> <a href=\"/en\">Home</a><span class=\"separator\">/</span></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Liquid Waste Treatment by Road</li></ol></nav></div><div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-extra-field-blocknodepagelinks\" id=\"it-\"></div><div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodepagefield-icona\" id=\"it-\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-icona field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><article class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/trattamento.png\" width=\"99\" height=\"99\" alt=\"icona trattamento\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div></div><div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodepagetitle\" id=\"it-\"> <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-above\">Liquid Waste Treatment by Road</span></div><div class=\"block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodepagebody\" id=\"it-\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><strong>Calice Treatment Plant</strong></p><p>The sewage treatment plant is located inside the Calice depuration plant and has been active since 1992.<br>The plant consists of 2 disposal lines, the first dedicated to the treatment of E.E.R. codes 20.03.4 - 20.03.06 and a capacity of 2,250 tons/week, 117,000 tons/year.<br>The second dedicated to the treatment of E.E.R. codes 19.07.03 - 16.10.02 and a potential of 3,750 + 20% t/week, 195,000 t/year.</p><p class=\"orari_impianto\"><strong>The I.T.L. of Calice has the following schedule:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from 7.30 to 19.00 every weekday;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from 7.30 to 12.00 on Saturdays;<br>Weekly closing: during public holidays</strong></p><p><strong>Baciacavallo treatment plant</strong></p><p>The slurry treatment plant is located inside the Baciacavallo depuration plant and has been active since 2016.<br>The plant consists of 1 disposal line dedicated to the treatment of E.E.R. codes 20.03.4 and a capacity of 230 t/day, 900 t/week.</p><p class=\"orari_impianto\"><strong>The I.T.L. of Baciacavallo has the following schedule:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from 7.00 to 18.30 every weekday;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from 7.00 to 12.00 on Saturdays;<br>Weekly closing: during public holidays</strong></p><div class=\"cke-ig\"><img alt=\"itl\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"800\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/itl_impianti3.jpg\" width=\"900\"><img alt=\"itl\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"800\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/itl_impianti2.jpg\" width=\"900\"><img alt=\"itl\" draggable=\"false\" height=\"800\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/itl_impianti4.jpg\" width=\"900\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"768\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/itl_impianti17.jpg\" width=\"576\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div> </main>"
